<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Renong year net up 96 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Renong year net up 96 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 407.11   vs	 207.83</p>
<p>    Shr	 (cents)	 23.6    vs	  12.6</p>
<p>    Turnover		 1,064.76   vs	 319.13</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   682.02   vs	 269.43</p>
<p>    Minorities	 less  120.02   vs less    5.08</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	  112.92   vs	   3.37</p>
<p>    Dividend   (percent)     4.0    vs	   4.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's Renong Bhd is a diverse conglomerate.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
